[phase0]   SIDE FINDING: the 3 continuation AIRs were also outside ood_window_ir_tests, which guards a real soundness bug (next-row columns pruned to zero). They pass with exact=true, so no bug — but they were unguarded until now.
[phase0]   TESTED: artifacts_are_invariant_across_trace_length - the axis is structurally absent (no AIR ctor takes a trace length), so the test sweeps composition_poly_degree_bound(n) == k*n for n = 2^4..2^24 on all 28, which is the only route trace length could reach the artifact. Passes. Plus capture determinism.
